---
/**
 * PricingSection — single source of truth for Foundation/Growth/Authority pricing preview.
 * Used on homepage and services page. Full details at /packages.
 */
---

<section class="border-t border-gray-100 bg-white py-20" id="packages">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4">
    <div class="mb-12 text-center">
      <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl font-bold text-heading md:text-4xl">Simple, Honest Pricing</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-base text-body">Month-to-month. No setup fees. No contracts. GBP management included in every plan.</p>
      <span class="mx-auto mt-4 block h-1 w-12 rounded bg-primary"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 md:grid-cols-3">
      <article class="flex flex-col rounded-3xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-heading">Foundation</h3>
        <div class="mt-2 flex items-baseline gap-1">
          <span class="font-heading text-4xl font-extrabold text-primary">$599</span>
          <span class="text-sm text-body">/mo</span>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-body">GBP fully managed plus steady on-page SEO progress each month.</p>
        <div class="my-5 h-px bg-gray-100"></div>
        <ul class="flex-1 space-y-2.5 text-sm text-body">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><svg class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-primary" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5"/></svg>Full GBP management — posts, photos, reviews, Q&A</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><svg class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-primary" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5"/></svg>On-page fixes — titles, metas, schema</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><svg class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-primary" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5"/></svg>Up to 5 pages/mo + citation cleanup</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><svg class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-primary" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5"/></svg>Monthly performance report</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/packages" data-evt="cta_pricing_foundation" class="mt-8 block rounded-xl border border-primary px-6 py-3 text-center text-sm font-semibold text-primary transition hover:bg-primary hover:text-white">Get Started</a>
      </article>
      <article class="relative flex flex-col rounded-3xl border-2 border-primary bg-white p-8 shadow-lg">
        <div class="absolute -top-3.5 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2">
          <span class="rounded-full bg-primary px-4 py-1 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white shadow">Most Popular</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-heading">Growth</h3>
        <div class="mt-2 flex items-baseline gap-1">
          <span class="font-heading text-4xl font-extrabold text-primary">$999</span>
          <span class="text-sm text-body">/mo</span>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-body">Higher content volume, backlinks, and AI search visibility for businesses ready to dominate.</p>
        <div class="my-5 h-px bg-gray-100"></div>
        <ul class="flex-1 space-y-2.5 text-sm text-body">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><svg class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-primary" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5"/></svg>Everything in Foundation</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><svg class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-primary" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5"/></svg>5 pages/mo + 2 blog posts + 2–3 backlinks</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><svg class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-primary" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5"/></svg>AEO schema — FAQ, HowTo, entity optimization</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><svg class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-primary" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5"/></svg>Monthly report + 45-min strategy call</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/packages" data-evt="cta_pricing_growth" class="mt-8 block rounded-xl bg-primary px-6 py-3 text-center text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow transition hover:bg-primary-dark">Get Started</a>
      </article>
      <article class="flex flex-col rounded-3xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-heading">Authority</h3>
        <div class="mt-2 flex items-baseline gap-1">
          <span class="font-heading text-4xl font-extrabold text-primary">$1,499</span>
          <span class="text-sm text-body">/mo</span>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-body">Maximum output for businesses that want to dominate their market.</p>
        <div class="my-5 h-px bg-gray-100"></div>
        <ul class="flex-1 space-y-2.5 text-sm text-body">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><svg class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-primary" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5"/></svg>Everything in Growth</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><svg class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-primary" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5"/></svg>Up to 10 pages/mo + 4 blogs + 4–6 backlinks</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><svg class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-primary" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5"/></svg>Quarterly AI Visibility Audit included</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><svg class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-primary" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5"/></svg>Bi-weekly check-ins + priority turnaround</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/packages" data-evt="cta_pricing_authority" class="mt-8 block rounded-xl border border-primary px-6 py-3 text-center text-sm font-semibold text-primary transition hover:bg-primary hover:text-white">Get Started</a>
      </article>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-8 text-center text-sm text-body">
      All plans include a <strong>$1,200 site build option</strong> and <strong>$199/mo maintenance</strong> add-on.
      <a href="/packages" class="font-semibold text-primary underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-primary-dark">See full pricing details →</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
